<title>USA: Hudson Foods sees continued strong sales.</title>
<headline>Hudson Foods sees continued strong sales.</headline>
<dateline>ROGERS, Ark. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson Foods Inc said on Tuesday that it expects strong sales to continue in the coming year and grain costs to return to more normal levels after January.</p>
<p>The poultry producer reported earlier today that fourth quarter earnings had risen to $0.29 from $0.28 a year ago. It said it was &quot;somewhat satisified&quot; with the year's results, given pressures from higher grain prices.</p>
</text>
